<title>USA: Wisconsin Energy unit sets $200 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Wisconsin Energy unit sets $200 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Wisconsin Energy unit, Wisconsin Electric Power was priced on Tuesday via Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER WISCONSIN ELECTRIC POWER</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.625 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.920  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 6.636 PCT   PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA	  SPREAD 45/WI	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
